    "title": "Residents need to do their part to fight abuse of our amenities - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Letters to the Editor ,\n9 hours ago I believe most of us agree with the Letter to the Editor about abuse of our amenities. It’s frustrating when you see people using and abusing what doesn’t belong to them. On that same note, why do Villagers feel that since they’re Villagers they don’t have to show identification? I know wherever I go it is MY responsibility to have my proof of residency and not complain about showing it. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
